# BundleFi Frontend Environment Variables
# Place this file in the ROOT of your frontend project (same folder as package.json)

# ── Solana RPC ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Devnet public RPC — fine for development.
# For higher rate limits use Helius free tier: https://helius.dev
VITE_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com

# ── Treasury Wallet ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This wallet RECEIVES the devnet SOL when users invest in a bundle.
#
# HOW TO GET ONE:
#   1. Open Phantom wallet
#   2. Click the account icon (top left) → "Add / Connect Wallet" → "Create New Wallet"
#   3. Switch the new wallet to Devnet: Settings → Developer Settings → Devnet
#   4. Copy the wallet address and paste it below
#
# The address looks like: 7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU
VITE_TREASURY_WALLET=5ExNAo2kjXG1LsJ7QvCanYoPKiagUkyb3sFjmgc8JPYz
